    "chunk_text": "Furthermore, plans are underway to provide necessary infrastructure to establish High Courts in rented buildings on an urgent basis in locations with heavy case backlogs. Priority, under this plan, has been assigned to the following High Courts:\n\nProposed High\n\nCourt\n\nNumber of\n\nPending\n\nCases 01 Negombo 1,414\n\n02 Galle 1,678\n\n03 Kurunegala 1,819\n\n04 Matara 1,372\n\n05 Kalutara 1,078\n\n06 Kandy - currently has two courtrooms\n\n2,026\n\n08 Gampaha - currently has two courtrooms\n\n1,560\n\n09 Kegalle 893\n\n10 Avissawella 730\n\n11 Balapitiya 732\n\n12 Jaffna 739\n\nThe above proposal for the establishment of High Courts is to be submitted to the Judicial Service Commission after arrangements for providing the necessary infrastructure have been finalized.\n\n(b) (i) 23.\n\n(ii) 33.\n\n(iii) 05.\n\n(iv) 05.\n\n(c) As informed by the Judicial Service Commission, due to the insufficient number of judicial officers in the lower courts, it had not been possible to promote judicial officers serving in those lower courts as High Court Judges. On 01.07.2026, 33 new judicial officers were recruited and they are currently undergoing training at the Sri Lanka Judges\u2019 Institute. Upon completion of the compulsory training programme, the newly recruited judicial officers will be assigned to courts. At present, the existing infrastructure is inadequate and there is also a severe shortage of human resources. Approval has now been obtained from the Ministry of Finance, Planning and Economic Development for the financial provisions required to fill the existing vacancies. Accordingly, the necessary examinations and interviews are currently being conducted, and required steps are being taken to recruit the necessary staff while providing the required infrastructure.\n\n(d) Does not arise.\n\n\u0db8\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0db8 \u0dc3\u0dc4 \u0db8\u0dd4\u0dbd\u0dad\u0dd2\u0dc0\u0dca \u0daf\u0dd2\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dca\u0d9a\u0dc0\u0dbd \u0dc0\u0dd9\u0dbb\u0dc5 \u0dbb\u0dc5\n\n\u0d9b\u0dcf\u0daf\u0db1\u0dba: \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0dc5\u0dd0\u0d9a\u0dca\u0dc0\u0dd3\u0db8 \u0bae\u0ba9\u0bcd\u0ba9\u0bbe\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0bae\u0bb1\u0bcd\u0bb1\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bcd \u0bae\u0bc1\u0bb2\u0bcd\u0bb2\u0bc8\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bc0\u0bb5\u0bc1 \u0bae\u0bbe\u0bb5\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bc0\u0bb5\u0bc1 \u0bae\u0bbe\u0bb5\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0b95\u0b9f\u0bb2\u0bb0\u0bbf\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bbf\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1: \u0ba4\u0b9f\u0bc1\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bb2\u0bcd COASTAL EROSION IN MANNAR AND MULLAITIVU\n\nDISTRICTS: PREVENTION"
