    "chunk_text": "\u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dc1\u0dca\u0db1\u0db1\u0dba \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc3\u0db1 \u0dbd\u0daf\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dca \u0dc3\u0db7\u0dcf \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dca\u0dd9\u0dad \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dba. \u0bb5\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bbe \u0bb5\u0bbf\u0b9f\u0bc1\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc1 \u0b8f\u0bb1\u0bcd\u0bb1\u0bc1\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0b95\u0bbe\u0bb3\u0bcd\u0bb3\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0ba4\u0bc1. Question put, and agreed to. \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 (\u0d86\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dba) \u0dc4\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0dbb\u0dc3\u0dd6\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0dba (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 (\u0b95\u0bb2\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bbf) \u0bb9\u0bbe\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bbf \u0b85\u0bae\u0bb0\u0b9a\u0bc2\u0bbe\u0bbf\u0baf) (The Hon. (Dr.) Harini Amarasuriya) Sir, I present the Report on the observations and steps taken in terms of the Standing Order No. 119(4) of the Parliament with regard to the matters mentioned on the Department for Registration of Persons in the Report of the Committee on Public Accounts, which was presented to Parliament.\n\nI move that this Report be referred to the Committee on Public Accounts.\n\n\u2022 Order made by the Minister of Finance, Planning and Economic Development under Section 19A of the Customs Ordinance (Chapter 235), as amended by the Customs (Amendment) Law No. 35 of 1974 and the Customs (Amendment) Act, No. 83 of 1988, relating to Customs Import Duty and published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2502/21 of 18th August, 2026; \u2022 Order made by the then Minister of Education under Section 27(1)(b) read with Sections 25A and 70C of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978 regarding the change of the name of the SLT Campus (Pvt.) Limited to Sri Lanka Technology Campus (Pvt.) Limited and published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2384/27 of 16th May, 2024; \u2022 Order made by the Minister of Education, Higher Education and Vocational Education under Section 25A of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978 with regard to the Bachelor of Science in Textile and Apparel Studies Degree awarded by Sri Lanka Institute of Textile and Apparel and published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2446/36 of 22nd July, 2025;\n\n815 816\n\n\u0dad\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0d9c\u0db4\u0dad\u0dca \u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0"
